    "friendlyName": "Train Classifier (Random Forest)",
    "description": "Fit/Train a Random Forest classifier: many Decision Trees, each grown on a bootstrapped sample of the rows and a random subset of the features, combined by majority vote. Far more robust to overfitting than a single tree, at the price of interpretability. Model size and fit time grow linearly with Ensemble Size, so a forest of 500 trees costs roughly 500x a single tree.",
